Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:05:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] util: add a Windows implementation of os_mman.h

Provide os_mmap()/os_munmap() on Windows for the anonymous-memory subset
of mmap() on top of VirtualAlloc()/VirtualFree(), and add os_mprotect()
for all platforms. Device-backed mappings fail with ENODEV: drivers have
to map device memory through their KMD interface on Windows.

Generated-by: LLM
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
